OL,5,G0000 The Buildings That Fought Hitler
OL,6,     FWe Shall Fight Them In The
OL,7,     FStreets: The physical defence of
OL,8,     FLondon was crucial. A ring of
OL,9,     Fsteel and concrete was thrown up
OL,10,     Faround the capital as well as
OL,11,     Futilising natural defences.
OL,12,G0100 The Buildings That Fought Hitler
OL,13,     FWe Shall Fight Them In The Fields:
OL,14,     FNumerous pill boxes, gun
OL,15,     Femplacements and dragon's teeth
OL,16,     Fwere all tactically positioned to
OL,17,     Fslow the Germans trying to get to
OL,18,     Fthe major cities.
