OL,3,Vupppppp5CWednesday
OL,5,G0350 The Buildings That Fought Hitler
OL,6,     FKeep The Home Fires Burning: With
OL,7,     Fthe blitz taking its toll, Britain
OL,8,     Fhad to keep it's manufacturing
OL,9,     Fgoing. Shadow factories were born
OL,10,     Fand were crucial in the production
OL,11,     Fof ammunition.
OL,12,G0440 The Buildings That Fought Hitler
OL,13,     FWe Shall Fight On The Beaches: Rob
OL,14,     FBell explores the coastal defence
OL,15,     Fnetwork built to defend Britain's
OL,16,     Fbeaches, including a tower in
OL,17,     FEssex which controlled mines laid
OL,18,     Facross the estuary.
